    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d15-a1">

                <pb facs="0144" n="26" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg26"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 21.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Robertson to Mr.
                            Wharton.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Galle</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1889-08-24"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 24, 1889</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 51.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to herewith inclose, at
                    his request, an affidavit of Mr. Frank Xavier Fisher, setting forth the
                    circumstances of his arrest and imprisonment by the authorities at Wolfurt,
                    district of Bregenz, Austria, and which will explain itself. Mr. Fisher returns
                    to America within probably a month, and seems anxious to hear from the
                    Department at his address as given at the foot of his statement.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Henry
                    Robertson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
